    {
      "id": "comment-83067229-4103-40bb-9105-1f753cbd0e6d",
      "type": "COMMENT",
      "name": "Welcome",
      "position": [
        -137,
        0
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "# Mood Ring - Affect from Text\n\nThis network maps text features to emotional valence.\n\n## To Do and Notice\n\n1. **Input features**: Word embeddings capture meaning\n2. **Hidden processing**: The network learns emotional patterns\n3. **Output**: A continuous valence value (-1 to +1)\n\n## Affect in Noodlings\n\nNoodlings use continuous affect (PAD model):\n- **P**leasure (valence)\n- **A**rousal (energy)\n- **D**ominance (control)\n\nPlus boredom and sorrow for richer expression.\n\n**Challenge**: What makes the network predict positive vs negative?",
        "width": 450,
        "show_on_start": true
      },
      "inputs": {},
      "outputs": {},
      "weights": {},
      "collapsed": false,
      "color": "#5c4a3d",
      "tags": [],
      "description": "Tutorial introduction"
    }
